{"step_index":577,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T00:23:38Z","thinking":"Analyzing the provided Excel header image and the requested fields. The highlighted \"업종(NICE Biz)\" suggests a key focus on this industry classification. The request specifically asks for \"회사명 사업자번호 대표자 우편번호 주소\" implying extraction of these columns from the dataset.\n\n\nThe user's intent appears to be data enrichment: extracting specified company information for the first 500 entries from a provided list. The target data includes company name, business registration number, and other fields, to be sourced from a business information platform. A critical first step will be to verify the source of this 500-entry list (is it the prior pasted text or an Excel master?), and then parse the company names and business registration numbers from the list.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Extract top 500 company targets from user uploaded TSV.","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import json\nimport re\n\nwith open(r'C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e270-cdbb-4526-97ab-99f7d77523f7\\scratch\\user_uploaded_raw.tsv', 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    text = f.read()\n\nlines = [l for l in text.split('\\n') if l.strip() and not l.startswith('<') and not l.startswith('NOTE:')]\n\nraw_entries = []\nfor l in lines:\n    parts = l.split('\\t')\n    # handle cases where parts has author or not\n    # format is: [작성자, 비고, 회사명, 사업자번호, 대표자, 우편번호, 주소, 전화번호, 팩스번호, 홈페이지, 이메일, 종업원수, 업종(NICE), 법인번호, 결산월, 업종_대, 업종_중, 업종_소...]\n    # If author is omitted, parts[0] might be empty or parts[0] is company name\n    while len(parts) < 18:\n        parts.append('')\n        \n    cname = parts[2].strip() if parts[2].strip() else parts[1].strip()\n    bno = re.sub(r'[^0-9]', '', parts[3].strip() if parts[3].strip() else parts[2].strip())\n    \n    # If parts[2] looks like bno and parts[1